OL,3,GNEWSASeven fines for street wees in
OL,4,Ascheme's first year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new council scheme aimed at cutting
OL,7,Fpublic urination in York handed out
OL,8,Fjust seven fines in its first year.
OL,10,FThe fixed penalty notices (FPNs) for
OL,11,Fstreet urination issued between June
OL,12,F2025 and this July had a combined value
OL,13,Fof #325 and three went unpaid, City of
OL,14,FYork Council figures showed.
OL,16,FIn the same period, the city's Business
OL,17,FImprovement District (BID) cleaning
OL,18,Fteams attended 4,891 incidents.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
