OL,3,GNEWSASeven fines for street wees in
OL,4,Ascheme's first year
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil communities lead Pauline
OL,7,FStuchfield said the vast majority of
OL,8,Foffences happened at night meaning the
OL,9,Fissuing of fines relied on witness
OL,10,Fstatements coming from partner
OL,11,Forganisations working during those
OL,12,Ftimes.
